abstract: >-
  Physics-aware MCP server for COMSOL Multiphysics.
  Enables LLM-driven mesh generation, solver configuration,
  parametric sweeps, analytic gas property bypass, and
  automated 2D-to-3D model conversion via the COMSOL Java API.
